"Orang Utan": ...
Sira: (This is Mr. Pisang. He's an orangutan.)
if {feeding_animals} == true:
	Sira: (Jitendra found him alone in the forest without a mother.)
	Sira: (Usually, young orang utans depend on their mothers until they reach around 7-8 years of age.)
	Sira: (He's all grown up now, but Jitendra basically raised him like his own child.)
	Sira: (Mr. Pisang doesn't seem to care about everyone else except for Jitendra.)
	Sira: (Sometimes the people here think orang utans can speak and understand human language, but they chose not to.)
	Sira: (Sometimes I see Mr. Pisang voluntarily bringing injured animals to Jitendra so he could help them.)
	- Feed Orang Utan.
		[signal arg="animal_fed"]
		audio "res://asset/sound/crunch.mp3"
		*Mr. Pisang grabs Sira's hand while eating the fruit to show his appreciation.*
	- Later.
		Sira: (I'll feed him later.)